  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 729 × 9 – (56 – 6) × 5 ÷ 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) × and + \n\nGiven: 729 × 9 – (56 – 6) × 5 ÷ 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 729 + 9 – __**(56 – 6)**__ +** **5 ÷ 2 × 152 + 19 = 69\n\n⇒ 729 + 9 - 50 +** **__**5 ÷ 2**__ × 152** **+ 19 = 69\n\n⇒ 729 + 9 - 50 + __2.5 × 152__ + 19 = 69\n\n⇒ __**729 + 9**__ - 50 + __**380 + 19**__ = 69\n\n⇒ **__1137 - 50__ **= 69\n\n⇒ 1087 ≠ 69\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n**Option 2) × and ÷**\n\nGiven: 729 × 9 – (56 – 6) × 5 ÷ 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 729 ÷ 9 - **__(56 – 6)__ **÷ 5 × 2 + 152 ÷ 19 = 69\n\n⇒ __**729 ÷ 9**__ - __**50 ÷ 5**__ × 2 + __**152 ÷ 19**__ = 69\n\n⇒ 81 - __**10 × 2**__ + 8 = 69\n\n⇒ __81__ - 20 __+ 8__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**89 - 20**__ = 69\n\n⇒ **69 = 69 **\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷ and – \n\nGiven: 729 × 9 – (56 – 6) × 5 ÷ 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 729 × 9 ÷** __(56 ÷ 6)__** × 5 - 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\n⇒ 729 × **__9 ÷ 9.33__** × 5 - 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\n⇒ __**729 × 83.97 × 5**__ - 2 + __**152 × 19**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**306070**__ - 2 __**+ 2888**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**308958 - 2**__ = 69\n\n⇒ 308956 ≠ 69\n\nAs we got a decimal value we cannot obtain a exact value by calculating further.\n\nOption 4) + and – \n\nGiven: 729 × 9 – (56 – 6) × 5 ÷ 2 + 152 × 19 = 69\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 729 × 9 + __(56 + 6)__ × 5 ÷ 2 - 152 × 19 = 69\n\n⇒ 729 × 9 + 62 × __5 ÷ 2__ - 152 × 19 = 69\n\n⇒ __**729 × 9**__ + __**62 × **__**__2.5__** - __**152 × 19**__ = 69\n\n⇒** __6561 + 155__** - 2888 = 69\n\n⇒** __6716 - 2888__** = 69\n\n⇒ 3828 ≠ 69\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
